-- 301 -> 200). The other four were ipatent.me (registration dropped: the registrar reports the name available) and
-- empoweringchange.today (payment expired 2026-09-19), both under human_actions 65 (lapse adopted) and 73.
-- 1. public_hosts_broken's formula says what it now counts.
-- 2. failure mode host-census-false-positive with its detector: the latest census row records the retry policy and the
--    owner-bound list (it reads 0 until the first census with this code, at most 6 h after the merge).
-- 3. blocker_redteam: blocker_redteam 116 expected empoweringchange.today's edge certificate to come back on its own after the
--    2026-10-12 unpause; 15 h later it has not, and the reads below say why waiting will not fix it.
